"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Weidm&#xFC;ller</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Weidm&#xFC;ller RockStar heavy-duty connectors</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">RockStar heavy-duty connectors transmit power, signals and data for machines &#x2013; modular assembly, fast and robust connections.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["weidmueller"], "giaiphap": ["power-distribution-quality"]}, "model": "RockStar HDC"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl1000-signal-isolators/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/gbvpgwbl/mtl1000.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd61434473f878\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL1000 DIN-rail signal isolators</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">DIN-rail signal conditioning isolators and trip amplifiers for safe-area loops &#x2013; protect field instruments and control systems from noise and earth loops.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "MTL1000"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl4600-signal-isolators/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/445deuno/mtl4600.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd61434485ccbc\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL4600 backplane signal isolators</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Backplane-mounted non-IS signal isolators that share MTL4500 backplanes &#x2013; for DCS, ESD and fire &amp; gas systems.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "MTL4600"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl830c-temperature-multiplexer/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/hwkflqta/mtl830c.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614344912263\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL830C temperature multiplexer system</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Carries up to 32 hazardous-area (Zone 0) temperature inputs over a single twisted pair with Modbus output &#x2013; cuts installed wiring cost by up to 50%.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control", "hazardous-area-safety"]}, "model": "MTL830C"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl4851-mtl4852-hart-multiplexers/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/xhtdm03k/mtl4851-4852.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614344d62e9a\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL4851/MTL4852 HART connection system</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">16-channel HART multiplexers linking smart field devices to instrument management software &#x2013; up to 7936 HART devices on one RS485 network.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "MTL4851 / MTL4852"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl-fieldbus-power-supplies/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain