ents</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL fieldbus diagnostics and test tools</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">F809F-Plus module continuously monitors eight fieldbus segments; FBT-6 / FBT-6-PA handheld testers support maintenance and fault-finding.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "F809F-Plus / FBT-6 / FBT-6-PA"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl-fieldbus-displays/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/zcuhiph0/mtl-fieldbus-displays.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614345604272\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL fieldbus displays</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">FOUNDATION&#x2122; fieldbus H1 and Profibus PA displays, 1 to 8 variables, field or panel mount, for safe and hazardous areas.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control", "hazardous-area-safety"]}, "model": "BA / FD series"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/eaton-mtl-9460-et-is-ethernet/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/mx1mxijw/mtl-9460-et.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143456ddade\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL 9460-ET 10/100 Mbps intrinsically safe Ethernet</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">10/100 Mbps intrinsically safe Ethernet for Zone 1: switches, fibre converters, isolators, wireless access units and 949x-PS-Plus IS power &#x2013; power and data on one cable (PoEx&#x2122;).</p