odule.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "RTK UC625"}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/en/products/automation/mtl-rtk-wall-mounting-annunciator-system/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/c55alg2f/rtk-wall.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6486756b834a\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">MTL RTK wall-mounting alarm annunciator system</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Complete alarm system pre-built in a wall-mounted enclosure: annunciator, MCB, power supply, audible, pushbuttons and terminals &#x2013; ready to wire on site, 1 &#x2013; 256 ways.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">View details →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["automation-control"]}, "model": "RTK wall-mounting annunciator system"}], "size": 24}